A '''Hunting Toolkit''' is a {{Rare}} item that can hold{{Skill|Hunting}} [[Tools]].

== Obtaining ==
A '''Hunting Toolkit''' can be purchased for {{c|1,000,000}} from {{NPCSprite|David Hunterborough}}.

== Usage ==
A '''Hunting Toolkit''' can be consumed once to permanently unlock the '''Hunting Toolkit''' menu and gain {{SBXP|2}}.

The '''Hunting Toolkit''' menu can be opened in the player's [[Storage]] or with the {{gray|/huntingtoolkit}} command. 

It can store one of each {{Skill|Hunting}} [[Tools|Tool]] and {{Green|5}} [[Huntrap]]s.

